title: <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Anti-Bolshevik Leagues</span> unbanned
subtitle: The judges have re-legalized the <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Anti-Bolshevik Leagues</span>.
new-page: true
view-if: abl_banned == 1 and abl_ban_timer == 0 and (judicial_reform < 2 or pnf_in_government) and not national_congress_seen and not pnf_banned and not march_failed
on-arrival: abl_banned = 0; abl_strength += 20; abl_militancy += 0.04; nationalist_sentiment += 6;
tags: event

Judges have ordered the <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Anti-Bolshevik Leagues</span> to be re-legalized. They immediately return to mass recruiting and arming.
